      "uuid": "0c9ff641-9cf6-498e-9738-70b7b637f1d0",
      "name": " A HOW TO GUIDE",
      "description": "    So you\u0027ve decided NOT to pay the FOP\u0027s prices for their DLC? Welcome to the open seas, crewmate!\n   When you pirate a DLC in the main Q.U.E.S.T. Tablet, it completes the original DLC quest for you. And when you hold the DLC book in your inventory, it will unlock in this Shop Tablet too.\n    While alone that isn\u0027t super useful to you, Bandit, if you have other assistants, it makes it easier to buy a copy of the DLC for them.",
